# The curation home is the checkout during dev, so its three dataset trees land
# here: the input, the workspace the tools write, and the tree Export publishes
# to. `/workspace/` is anchored -- a bare `workspace/` would also swallow the
# `anime_tools/workspace/` package, which is source.
image_dataset/
/workspace/
post_image_dataset/
bench/*/results/
_archive/

